stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Starting: process start
    Starting --> Syncing: BuildSim healthy,<br/>MQTT connected
    Syncing --> Running: retained states received /<br/>equipment registered
    Running --> Degraded: inputs bad: broker lost,<br/>gateway offline, > 20 %<br/>zones stale, BuildSim<br/>unreachable
    Degraded --> Running: inputs recover<br/>(reconnected,<br/>fresh readings)
    Running --> Stopping: SIGTERM
    Degraded --> Stopping: SIGTERM
    Stopping --> Stopped: tick finished,<br/>"offline" published
    Stopped --> [*]
    Running --> [*]: crash: last will "offline",<br/>or watchdog exit after 120 s
    note right of Degraded
        Network drop: reconnect<br/>every 1–10 s, re-subscribe,<br/>re-publish the status;<br/>QoS 1 commands wait in<br/>a queue. Meanwhile the<br/>last will says "offline";<br/>the agent keeps all water<br/>on while Degraded.
    end note
